<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 18.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Thousands of Baltic Challenge troops flooded Tallinn as they took a day off.</p>
<p>- Agricultural producers discuss new subsidies with the government.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
